WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.216 --> 00:00:18.102
"My gecko is Mrs.

2
00:00:18.162 --> 00:00:19.103
Hubbletree wailed.

3
00:00:19.123 --> 00:00:23.805
"I went to get him from his terrarium, but he is not there!"

4
00:00:23.825 --> 00:00:29.247
"Freaky!" The mayor scanned the gym until he located Mr.

5
00:00:29.307 --> 00:00:31.748
Freaky hiding behind a large dog.

6
00:00:32.844 --> 00:00:34.845
"Now, now, Mayor Hubbletree!"

7
00:00:35.205 --> 00:00:36.665
Mr. Freaky said quickly.

8
00:00:36.685 --> 00:00:40.286
"I'm sure everything is totally under control!"

9
00:00:42.707 --> 00:00:44.187
A judge went over to Mrs.

10
00:00:44.227 --> 00:00:51.269
Hubbletree. geckos can change color," the judge said calmly.

11
00:00:51.289 --> 00:00:55.010
"Maybe Bowie is simply blending into his terrarium."

12
00:00:55.030 --> 00:01:00.992
"Are you saying my wife can't find her own pet?"

13
00:01:01.556 --> 00:01:02.857
Mayor Hubbletree demanded.

14
00:01:03.478 --> 00:01:04.999
Mrs. Hubbletree shook her head.

15
00:01:05.019 --> 00:01:08.041
"I looked carefully," she insisted.

16
00:01:08.061 --> 00:01:11.103
"Somebody stole my precious Bowie!"

17
00:01:11.123 --> 00:01:14.526
"Lock down this place immediately!"

18
00:01:14.846 --> 00:01:16.027
Mayor Hubbletree shouted.

19
00:01:16.047 --> 00:01:20.270
"Nobody gets in or out until Bowie is found!"

20
00:01:22.652 --> 00:01:24.694
Miss Bungle hurried toward the microphone.

21
00:01:25.034 --> 00:01:27.236
"There's no need for panic.

22
00:01:27.880 --> 00:01:33.303
We're going to check our security camera to see if we can spot any suspicious activity near the

23
00:01:33.403 --> 00:01:34.704
gecko's terrarium.

24
00:01:35.584 --> 00:01:39.487
We'll also check to see if anyone suspicious recently left the building."

25
00:01:39.507 --> 00:01:41.628
"What are you talking about?"

26
00:01:41.848 --> 00:01:43.068
Mayor Hubbletree yelled.

27
00:01:43.088 --> 00:01:47.431
"This place is crawling with vampires, ghosts, and ghouls.

28
00:01:47.771 --> 00:01:49.912
Half the crowd looks suspicious!"

29
00:01:50.633 --> 00:01:53.134
Ben and Winnie exchanged nervous glances.

30
00:01:53.154 --> 00:01:56.356
"This is getting totally out of control," Ben murmured.

31
00:02:00.682 --> 00:02:05.705
"Students, do not take action by yourselves," Miss Bungle added.

32
00:02:05.725 --> 00:02:10.127
"If you spot anything unusual, notify me or Mr.

33
00:02:10.227 --> 00:02:11.568
Freaky immediately."

34
00:02:11.588 --> 00:02:14.409
"This is terrible," Ben said.

35
00:02:14.429 --> 00:02:15.570
"Poor Mrs.

36
00:02:15.650 --> 00:02:17.931
Hubbletree. I wish we could do something."

37
00:02:17.951 --> 00:02:23.114
"I could cast a location spell," Waldo said.

38
00:02:23.134 --> 00:02:26.136
"No!" Ben and Winnie said at once.

39
00:02:26.944 --> 00:02:30.265
"I bet Rex-Rex could sniff out Bowie," Mog said.

40
00:02:30.285 --> 00:02:32.366
"Hey, that's a good idea!"

41
00:02:32.666 --> 00:02:33.287
Ben said.

42
00:02:33.307 --> 00:02:35.588
"Rex-Rex could pick up his scent."

43
00:02:36.368 --> 00:02:40.550
"We just need to find something that belongs to Bowie," Mog said.

44
00:02:40.570 --> 00:02:44.631
"Oswald can look for him too," Waldo reached for Oswald's cage.

45
00:02:44.651 --> 00:02:47.312
"No!" Winnie and Ben said again.

46
00:02:47.332 --> 00:02:49.413
"Let's go!"

47
00:02:49.833 --> 00:02:54.215
Mog said, bringing Rex-Rex over to Bowie's terrarium for a good sniff.

48
00:02:54.795 --> 00:03:00.470
Almost immediately, Rex-Rex took off, dragging Mog all over the school as he sniffed.

49
00:03:02.691 --> 00:03:03.951
Ben hurried after them.

50
00:03:03.971 --> 00:03:06.452
"How's it going?"

51
00:03:06.852 --> 00:03:08.253
he asked a few minutes later.

52
00:03:09.474 --> 00:03:10.314
Mog shrugged.

53
00:03:10.334 --> 00:03:13.875
"It seems like Rex-Rex smells him everywhere.

54
00:03:14.476 --> 00:03:15.336
Maybe—" "Shh."

55
00:03:17.177 --> 00:03:20.978
Ben pointed to Miss Bungle who was about to make another announcement.

56
00:03:20.998 --> 00:03:22.719
"Maybe they found him."

57
00:03:23.359 --> 00:03:24.740
But Bowie was still missing.

58
00:03:25.580 --> 00:03:32.342
"After checking the camera," Miss Bungle began, "we believe Bowie is still in the building.

59
00:03:32.982 --> 00:03:34.583
But we need help with our search.

60
00:03:35.143 --> 00:03:39.404
Can all of the pet show volunteers please step up to the stage?"

61
00:03:42.665 --> 00:03:43.505
Sid grinned.

62
00:03:43.525 --> 00:03:46.306
"We get to be security guards!"

63
00:03:46.866 --> 00:03:47.586
Ben nodded.

64
00:03:47.606 --> 00:03:48.666
"Let's go, Sid."

65
00:03:50.467 --> 00:03:54.588
Ben and Sid searched some classrooms on the first floor and the cafeteria.

66
00:03:56.588 --> 00:03:58.569
"Bowie can change color," Ben said.

67
00:03:58.589 --> 00:04:00.450
"He could be blending in anywhere."

68
00:04:02.611 --> 00:04:06.213
After about half an hour, they gave up and reentered the gym.

69
00:04:11.576 --> 00:04:12.217
Ben said.

70
00:04:12.577 --> 00:04:14.918
He saw Mayor Hubbletree glaring at Waldo.

71
00:04:15.859 --> 00:04:17.179
The ghosts hurried over.

72
00:04:17.199 --> 00:04:20.761
"We demand to search that cage!"

73
00:04:21.201 --> 00:04:22.162
the mayor snapped.

74
00:04:22.902 --> 00:04:26.136
"Your owl tried to eat the witch's kitten," Mrs.

75
00:04:26.176 --> 00:04:26.997
Hubbletree added.

76
00:04:27.017 --> 00:04:29.298
"I think it ate Bowie too!"

77
00:04:29.318 --> 00:04:32.000
"Oswald hasn't eaten anyone!"

78
00:04:32.300 --> 00:04:33.381
Waldo protested.

79
00:04:33.401 --> 00:04:37.784
"Take your pet out of that cage right now!"

80
00:04:38.325 --> 00:04:39.525
Mayor Hubbletree ordered.

81
00:04:39.545 --> 00:04:40.926
"Show him to me!"

82
00:04:41.827 --> 00:04:42.768
Waldo sighed.

83
00:04:42.788 --> 00:04:47.831
"As I just said, Mayor Hubbletree, my owl is invisible.

84
00:04:48.351 --> 00:04:49.872
So I can't show him to you."

85
00:04:50.713 --> 00:04:53.295
"We want to see for ourselves!"

86
00:04:53.815 --> 00:04:54.796
the mayor demanded.

87
00:04:55.660 --> 00:04:57.121
"Fine!" Waldo said.

88
00:04:57.141 --> 00:05:00.904
"I'll show you what—" He opened the cage and reached inside.

89
00:05:00.924 --> 00:05:05.087
"Uh-oh." Ben gulped.

90
00:05:06.989 --> 00:05:07.849
"What's wrong, Waldo?"

91
00:05:07.869 --> 00:05:11.232
"Oswald escaped again!"

92
00:05:11.252 --> 00:05:16.976
Mrs. Hubbletree gasped and Mayor Hubbletree's face turned bright red.

93
00:05:16.996 --> 00:05:21.420
"Are you telling me that your owl is loose?"

94
00:05:22.640 --> 00:05:25.902
"Oswald hasn't actually hurt anyone," Ben said quickly.

95
00:05:25.922 --> 00:05:29.284
"Inky is fine, and—" Tears streamed down Mrs.

96
00:05:29.324 --> 00:05:30.285
Hubbletree's cheeks.

97
00:05:30.305 --> 00:05:32.646
"My poor Bowie!"

98
00:05:33.126 --> 00:05:33.747
she sobbed.

99
00:05:34.707 --> 00:05:37.689
"Why did I ever think that he would be safe here?"

100
00:05:37.709 --> 00:05:40.451
"Now, now, dear."

101
00:05:40.731 --> 00:05:42.932
Mayor Hubbletree patted his wife's shoulder.

102
00:05:42.952 --> 00:05:45.654
"We'll find your precious Bowie."

103
00:05:45.674 --> 00:05:48.916
"Call Oswald, Waldo," Ben said.

104
00:05:49.640 --> 00:05:51.982
Waldo shrugged and whistled twice sharply.

105
00:05:52.002 --> 00:05:55.364
"Oswald, turn visible!"

106
00:05:55.864 --> 00:05:58.166
Ben held his breath as he looked upward.

107
00:05:59.847 --> 00:06:05.291
There was no sign of the owl until a fish monster shouted and pointed to the scoreboard.

108
00:06:05.311 --> 00:06:06.672
"There he is!"

109
00:06:07.873 --> 00:06:10.214
Waldo held out an arm and whistled again.

110
00:06:11.936 --> 00:06:15.318
This time the owl flew down and landed on Waldo's hand.

111
00:06:15.338 --> 00:06:17.099
"Good boy!"

112
00:06:17.399 --> 00:06:18.100
Waldo said.

113
00:06:19.028 --> 00:06:20.829
"He is not a good boy!"

114
00:06:21.249 --> 00:06:22.349
Mrs. Hubbletree said.

115
00:06:22.369 --> 00:06:24.410
"He stole my gecko!"

116
00:06:24.951 --> 00:06:26.411
Mayor Hubbletree looked grim.

117
00:06:26.431 --> 00:06:32.894
"I know where we'll find your gecko—inside that dangerous owl's stomach!"

118
00:06:33.634 --> 00:06:34.995
Mrs. Hubbletree gasped.

119
00:06:35.015 --> 00:06:38.716
"Are you saying what I think you're saying?"

120
00:06:38.736 --> 00:06:41.557
"Yes!" the mayor replied.

121
00:06:41.577 --> 00:06:46.679
"That's exactly what I'm saying—we're going to cut open that owl!"
